  @contract  widen stretches those windows to the nearest points instead, so none refuses  @ 2158
  @contract  selection must be exactly one grid column; multi-col selection is a no-op  @ 2956
  @invariant  a 1-col block stays contiguous when it lands on the destination col  @ 2957
  @contract  cursor follows to the destination column (single event and selection alike)  @ 2958
  @contract  refuse if dest col has any onset in source's row extent (note: note-on; else any event)  @ 2959
  @invariant  source's row extent = selection's [r1,r2] for a block, moved event's onset row for a single  @ 2960
  @invariant  tails (either direction) clipped by tm's tail pass; never block  @ 2961
